CE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里通义千问升级Qwen3.8-MAX模型并上线办公助理等核心功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b6dece8615fc06bfcee60eb8999fdae0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里通义千问大模型正式上线“思考研究”、“定时任务”及“办公助理”功能，并全面支持旗舰模型Qwen3.8-MAX。此次升级标志着大模型从辅助对话向自主执行转型。其中，“思考研究”模式强化了复杂推理与信息整合能力，可自动生成结构化汇报文档；“办公助理”功能具备连接外部应用与操作系统的能力，支持打通备忘录、日历及邮件，能自主操作浏览器完成多步骤任务并交付Office文档，同时实现手机与PC端的跨端协同。此外，“定时任务”功能支持自动化处理周期性工作，如行业简报梳理与邮件分类。通过整合语音通话能力与智能体广场，千问旨在构建覆盖专业办公到生活服务的全场景AI生态，旨在解决职场复杂决策与重复性工作痛点，推动AI在企业办公场景的落地普及。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布离线翻译硬件Gemma Translator，基于树莓派运行51亿参数模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c98465b9990f07b5c8d75ae0e9f5b496.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌Creative Lab团队于8月6日发布离线翻译设备Gemma Translator，该设备基于Raspberry Pi 5单板计算机开发，全程无需联网即可实现跨语种语音翻译。核心模型采用谷歌Gemma 4E2B，总参数量51亿，激活参数量23亿，专为资源受限的边缘设备设计。系统通过LiteRT-LM框架执行翻译推理，并集成Moonshine AI模型处理本地语音转写与合成。用户通过麦克风输入语音后，设备可实时在显示器输出译文并同步播报。此举展示了端侧模型从实验室演示向独立成品转化的路径，证明了在边缘计算环境下，通过优化模型与推理框架，可实现插电即用、不依赖云端的实时翻译能力，为边缘AI应用提供了明确的技术参考。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">字节要冲 5 万亿参数：豆包的智商有望拉满，代价是百万显卡级别算力</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d920e5095af766f1e5bde33cf9dac4e4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">字节要冲 5 万亿参数：豆包的智商有望拉满，代价是百万显卡级别算力AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Aug 7, 2026128国产大模型参数量正在从万亿级别继续上探。Qwen3.8Max、Kimi K3已经把规模顶到2.4万亿和2.8万亿，再往下一站就是5万亿。这一次，率先行动的可能是字节。晚点 LatePost 报道称，字节正在讨论训练一个超过5万亿参数量的大模型，将成为国内已知规模最大的模型。不过计划还在早期阶段，最终不一定会发布。5万亿参数是什么量级。它被视为 GPT-5.6或 Opus5级别。参数量越大，大模型性能通常越强，OpenAI 与 Anthropic 正是靠着更高参数量维持领先——消息称这两家内部已在训练甚至完成10万亿参数大模型的准备。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI首款自研AI硬件曝光：甜甜圈造型、冰球大小，预计2027年发布</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/52d3f21132ebb785afc1bf5c7019f1ff.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI首款自研AI硬件细节曝光，该设备由OpenAI与前苹果设计师Jony Ive合作开发，预计于2027年正式发布。产品外形呈“甜甜圈”造型，体积约为冰球大小（直径约7.62厘米），预估售价在300至400美元之间。该设备定位为无显示屏的家庭智能音箱，支持单手携带，配备可移动部件、灯光、摄像头及传感器，通过自动移动部件提示交互状态。交互核心基于更先进的对话模型，旨在提供类人语音互动体验，运行机制类似于手机端ChatGPT的语音模式。此次产品研发标志着OpenAI正式从软件层面切入硬件载体，通过与Jony Ive的深度合作，试图在工业设计与自然语音交互领域建立差异化竞争壁垒，为家庭场景提供便携式AI伴侣。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">ChatGPT正式接入Adobe全家桶，支持70多款创意工具一句话调用</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b947ac5e91223bb3eb606c2aa8ca4bc1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Adobe与OpenAI合作大幅扩容，自8月6日起，用户可在ChatGPT中直接调用Photoshop、Premiere、Acrobat、Lightroom、Illustrator及InDesign等70多款Adobe工具。用户通过在ChatGPT插件页面添加Adobe插件，输入“@Adobe”及具体任务指令，即可完成修图、视频剪辑及PDF生成等操作。该插件支持与OpenAI的Codex及Work套件协同，登录Creative Cloud账户后可同步云端文件并调用Adobe Firefly生成式AI模型。Adobe副总裁Forrest Key表示，此举旨在将专业工具嵌入用户工作流，但强调插件并非旗舰应用的替代品，复杂创作仍需依赖旗舰软件。此次集成标志着ChatGPT向“超级工作台”演进，通过消除软件切换壁垒，显</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
